===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{lb|en|usually|of relative importance|of degree, quantity or measure}} In a [[double]] manner; with twice the severity or degree.
#: {{ux|en|My mother was always '''doubly''' careful when winding the grandfather clock.}}
